WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.920
The Bible says: Hear, Israel.

2
00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:04.880
The LORD is our God.

3
00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:06.970
The LORD is one.

4
00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:10.610
Catholics keep this
belief: there is one God.

5
00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:13.340
Yet Catholics are baptised
in the name of the Father,

6
00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:15.610
the Son and the Holy Spirit.

7
00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:18.760
And the Bible also says that God is love.

8
00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:23.900
But if God is love, who did God
love before anything was made?

9
00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:29.170
In this mission, you'll find the Father,
the Son and the Spirit at Jesus' baptism.

10
00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:31.540
Then you'll trace how a council at Nicaea,

11
00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:36.020
in 325, shaped the creed
Catholics say at Mass.

12
00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:41.480
Your mission: find out who Catholics
believe God loved before anything was made.
